        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-16, Simple 3 inch Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEasy to install with the included hardware, easy to clean, and easy on the eyes, the 3 inch Cabinet Door Pull is a quick way to update the hardware in any home. The Simple Cabinet Pull's curved ends and traditional design is a beautiful example of the elegance of simplicity. With 6 finishes to choose from, you will be sure to find just the right one to match your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-16 Traditional Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
